  fhir:CodeSystem.description [ fhir:value "Declared facility implementation capacity tiers, retaining historical code identities. Capacity informs delivery format, sequence and support; it does not determine clinical eligibility, permit delayed risk-led care or exclude educational domains. All eight domains are offered at every tier. These labels are not a scored readiness instrument or proof of actual coverage."] ;
